# business-logic-vulns Rule

When auditing business logic:
1. Follow the checklist in `.agents/skills/business-logic-vulns/references/logic_vuln_checklist.md` (BLV-001 to BLV-020).
2. Master skill: `.agents/skills/business-logic-vulns/SKILL.md`. Track progress with `references/logic_vuln_tracker.md`.
3. Run `scripts/scope_check.sh TARGET` first. Use `scripts/route_target.py` to pick rows from recon artifacts.
4. Never complete real-money payments, transfers, or refunds. Race tests are authorized-only and capped at 2 to 5 parallel requests.
